abstract: >
  This source code implements a hybrid digital signature system for PDF
  documents that combines the Ed25519 digital signature algorithm with
  the post-quantum Falcon-512 signature scheme. The system supports key
  generation, PDF document signing, and signature verification, providing
  an additional layer of protection against conventional cryptographic
  attacks and potential future threats from quantum computing.

